== Trivia ==
* Lord of the Pit's icon resembles the Cross of St. Peter.
* The wings granted by Lord of the Pit are identical to {{c|Azazel}}'s wings.
* The item is a reference to a '[http://gatherer.wizards.com/Pages/Card/Details.aspx?multiverseid=193868 Magic: The Gathering]' card of the same name featuring a black-winged demonic creature on it, which is the appearance Isaac assumes upon picking up the item.
* "The Lord of the Gap" is a name commonly given to [[wikipedia:Belphegor|Belphegor]], the demon of sloth and invention.

